# harness-cache-7

GitHub-only toolchain cache for network-constrained agents.

```
git fetch origin tag harness-cache-7
python3 scripts/restore_agent_toolchain_cache.py --tag harness-cache-7 --prefix /path/to/toolchains
. /path/to/toolchains/env.sh
```

Every file is split into <90 MiB parts and verified against MANIFEST.sha256.
CACHE.json records the tool versions, roots, sizes and digests.
